en:
Yuumi
“So I read my books more closely than before;
so I treat people more courteously than before.

Yuumi
“At this rate, I’m like a toy soldier;
at this rate, every day is Sunday.

Yuumi
“I stroll slowly through the sunshine at the shrine,
and smile whenever I meet an acquaintance;

Yuumi
“The moss is cool indeed;
today, a fair day beyond all telling.

Yuumi
“Truly, life is a moment’s dream;
ah, the beauty of a rubber balloon.

Rina
“ZYPRESSEN, blacker and blacker;
the sparks of clouds rain down.”

Yuumi
“For the one we loved is dead;
beyond all doubt, that one is dead.”

Rin
“For the one we loved is dead;
beyond all doubt, that one is dead.”
